<title>USA: ADVO sees earnings growth in line with views.</title>
<headline>ADVO sees earnings growth in line with views.</headline>
<dateline>WINDSOR, Conn. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADVO Inc said on Tuesday it expects to see its earnings grow in line with current expectations for the remainder of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>ADVO also said in a news release that it expects unit volumes to remain strong for the rest of the fiscal year, but at a somewhat slower pace.</p>
<p>ADVO reported third quarter operating earnings of $0.38 per share, compared to $0.18 per share for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>ADVO is a direct mail marketing services company.</p>
</text>
